{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n今個寒冬及戶外活動必備！備受日本網民追捧的WORKMAN「XShelter」系列推出「断熱α 第一世代防水防寒外套」，主打「特殊隔熱薄片 × 吸光發熱棉」雙重鎖溫科技。內層採用極致輕薄的非熱傳導性獨立氣孔隔熱薄片，全方位阻隔外部冷空氣滲入並鎖住體溫，搭配吸光發熱鋪棉產生加倍保暖的相乘效果；面料同時具備防風、防水與優異吸放濕機能，能有效排走多餘濕氣，長時間穿著依然乾爽不悶熱。\n</p>\n<p>外套在防寒細節與收納機能上升級，特別針對容易入風的頸部加入鋪棉保暖設計，配合抽繩連帽調節、前襟防風防水擋片、魔術貼袖口、防刮下巴護片及貼合鬆緊下擺，全方位杜絕冷風與雨水灌入。衣身更配備高達6個多功能口袋，包括右內側拉鍊暗袋、左胸拉鍊袋、兩側拉鍊袋及翻蓋鈕扣袋及隔熱材質口袋，收納力極強；左袖亦貼心加入反光細節提升夜間視認性，無論日常通勤或嚴寒戶外活動都能輕鬆應對！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530180530415_18699096946afbedc62a277.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530180530415_18699096946afbedc62a277.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530347798278_11936436876afbedc7cd266.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530347798278_11936436876afbedc7cd266.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530523547232_12114037226afbedc98dcca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530523547232_12114037226afbedc98dcca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530703531176_2905532346afbedcb6ed0e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530703531176_2905532346afbedcb6ed0e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530926039607_618116756afbedcdaa7cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489530926039607_618116756afbedcdaa7cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489531099049618_15321099776afbedcf75650.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489531099049618_15321099776afbedcf75650.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df1ITJdFDdA/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.697196+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":502,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:21.991733+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:02:36.292045+00:00","content_hash":"2dbbbdd38cec83503fbcefbd092bf5acf10361adf897d8d5a8de781099935fd5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}